source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Read reports, suspend sites and lift suspensions.

Usage: ink abuse <COMMAND>

Commands
  list       The reports of strangers, newest first
  suspend    Take a site down
  reinstate  Lift a suspension

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink abuse --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
